# Vercel build context for the Governance Studio demo/serverless hosting profile.
#
# Allowlist, not a denylist: the repository is ~500 MB across 18k tracked files, and
# only the paths the function serves and the frontend build needs belong in the
# upload. Everything is excluded first, then the required paths are re-included.
#
# NOTE, deliberate: the repository-root requirements.txt is re-included below even
# though the function must NOT be built from it. Excluding it here would silently
# decide the dependency question by omission; it has to stay visible so the preview
# build log shows which requirements file the platform actually chooses. The
# entrypoint fails closed if that choice brings in a forbidden SDK.

*

# --- build + function entrypoint ---------------------------------------------
!vercel.json
!requirements.txt
!api/
!api/**

# --- frontend: built by the Vercel build command ------------------------------
!apps/
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/frontend/
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/frontend/**
apps/ugence-governance-studio/frontend/node_modules/
apps/ugence-governance-studio/frontend/test-results/
apps/ugence-governance-studio/frontend/e2e/
apps/ugence-governance-studio/frontend/tests/

# --- synthetic scenarios + frozen contract served by the API ------------------
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/demo_data/
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/demo_data/**
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/contracts/
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/contracts/**
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/backend/
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/backend/src/
!apps/ugence-governance-studio/backend/src/**

# --- deployment wrapper + its pinned synthetic manifest ------------------------
!deployment/
!deployment/governance-studio/
!deployment/governance-studio/src/
!deployment/governance-studio/src/**
!deployment/governance-studio/synthetic-scenarios-manifest.json

# --- local packages the function imports --------------------------------------
!packages/
!packages/capabilities/
!packages/capabilities/agent-workforce-composer/
!packages/capabilities/agent-workforce-composer/src/
!packages/capabilities/agent-workforce-composer/src/**
!packages/tooling/
!packages/tooling/policy-workflow-compiler/
!packages/tooling/policy-workflow-compiler/src/
!packages/tooling/policy-workflow-compiler/src/**

# --- never ship compiled or cached artefacts ----------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
